  "details": "<p>BAtlDir offers \"Kalantou, Naxos\" as the modern/name location gloss for this feature; Kalantos is another coastal village of Naxos, lying about 6km west of Panermos Naxou at the head of a different, sheltered bay. The feature labeled in BAtlas 61 B4 is clearly the eastern bay at modern Panermos village.</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "A small, sheltered bay on the southeast coast of the Aegean island of Naxos. The modern village of Panermos Naxou (referenced in RE as cited by BAtlDir) is situated at the head of the bay.",
